  "code": "class Solution:\n    def kthSmallest(self, root, k):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n        ans=-1\n        def dfs(node):\n            nonlocal k,ans\n            if node is None:\n                return None\n\n            dfs(node.left)\n            k-=1\n            if k == 0:\n                ans = node.val\n            dfs(node.right)\n\n        dfs(root)\n",
